32:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Laser eye surgery is one of the most commonly performed elective procedures in the world and has a high safety record. The vast majority of patients achieve excellent results, with many reaching 20/20 vision or better. However, like any surgical procedure, there are risks, including dry eyes, halos around lights, and, rarely, undercorrection or overcorrection. Optical Express will carry out a thorough assessment to determine whether you are a suitable candidate and will explain all potential risks before you decide to proceed."}]
33:["$","details","3",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] text-left","children":"Can I get a free eye test at Optical Express?"}],["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180","fill":"none","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","children":["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","d":"M19 9l-7 7-7-7"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 pb-5","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Yes, Optical Express provides free NHS-funded eye tests for all eligible patients. In Scotland, all residents qualify for free NHS eye tests regardless of age or income. In England, Wales, and Northern Ireland, eligibility includes children under 16, adults over 60, those on qualifying benefits, and people with specific medical conditions. Laser eye surgery consultations are also free and carry no obligation."}]}]]}]
34:["$","details","4",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] text-left","children":"Where are Optical Express clinics located?"}],["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180","fill":"none","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","children":["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","d":"M19 9l-7 7-7-7"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 pb-5","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Optical Express operates approximately 100 clinics across the United Kingdom and Ireland, located in major cities and towns including London, Birmingham, Manchester, Leeds, Edinburgh, Glasgow, Aberdeen, Cardiff, Belfast, and many more. Their clinics are typically in city centre locations for easy access."}]}]]}]
35:["$","details","5",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] text-left","children":"Can I book an Optical Express appointment through eyetest.co.uk?"}],["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180","fill":"none","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","children":["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","d":"M19 9l-7 7-7-7"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 pb-5","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Optical Express is not currently available for direct booking through eyetest.co.uk. We list Optical Express on our platform so that customers can compare their services and prices with other opticians. To book an eye test or laser surgery consultation, visit opticalexpress.co.uk or call their booking line directly. We hope to offer Optical Express booking through our platform in the future."}]}]]}]
36:["$","details","6",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] text-left","children":"Does Optical Express offer finance for laser eye surgery?"}],["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180","fill":"none","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","children":["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","d":"M19 9l-7 7-7-7"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 pb-5","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Yes, Optical Express offers a range of finance options for laser eye surgery, including interest-free credit for qualifying patients. Monthly payment plans allow you to spread the cost of treatment over 12 to 60 months. Finance is subject to credit approval, and full details are discussed during the initial consultation."}]}]]}]
37:["$","details","7",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] text-left","children":"What is the difference between LASIK and LASEK at Optical Express?"}],["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180","fill":"none","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","children":["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","d":"M19 9l-7 7-7-7"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 pb-5","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"LASIK and LASEK are both types of laser eye surgery, but they differ in how the laser accesses the cornea. LASIK involves creating a thin flap in the corneal surface before reshaping the underlying tissue with a laser — recovery is typically faster, with most patients seeing well within 24 hours. LASEK does not involve a flap; instead, the surface layer of the cornea is gently moved aside, and the laser reshapes the surface directly. LASEK recovery takes a few days longer, but it may be more suitable for patients with thinner corneas. Your Optical Express surgeon will recommend the best option based on your individual assessment."}]}]]}]
